        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Last of the Duanes\n- People: George Montgomery, Zane Grey, James Tinling, William Conselman Jr., Irving Cummings Jr.\n- Topics: American Western films, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- In 1941, Last of the Duanes was released as an American Western film.\n- Last of the Duanes was based on a novel by Zane Grey.\n- James Tinling directed Last of the Duanes.\n- William Conselman Jr. and Irving Cummings Jr. wrote Last of the Duanes.\n- George Montgomery was born as George Montgomery Letz on August 29, 1916.\n- George Montgomery was an American actor, painter, sculptor, furniture craftsman, and stuntman.\n- George Montgomery was best known as an actor in Western film and television.\n- George Montgomery died on December 12, 2000.",
